# Maintainer: Sidali Djeghbal <contact@djeghbal.me>
# The wikae-bin recipe on the AUR. .github/workflows/aur.yml sets the version and checksum and
# pushes it on each published release of https://github.com/Sidali-Djeghbal/wikae.
pkgname=wikae-bin
pkgver=2.4.1
pkgrel=1
pkgdesc='Spaced repetition with programmable card types and AI grading (desktop app)'
arch=('x86_64')
url='https://sidali-djeghbal.github.io/wikae'
license=('AGPL-3.0-only')
depends=('gtk3' 'nss' 'alsa-lib' 'libxss' 'libxtst' 'xdg-utils')
provides=('wikae')
conflicts=('wikae')
# Prebuilt: stripping Electron's binaries can break them.
options=('!strip' '!debug')
source=("wikae-$pkgver.deb::https://github.com/Sidali-Djeghbal/wikae/releases/download/v$pkgver/Wikae-linux-amd64.deb")
sha256sums=('SKIP')

package() {
  bsdtar -xf data.tar.xz -C "$pkgdir"
  # Updates come with the system's (yay -Syu); the app says so instead of downloading them.
  echo pacman > "$pkgdir/opt/Wikae/resources/package-type"
  install -d "$pkgdir/usr/bin"
  ln -s /opt/Wikae/resources/app/desktop/bin/wikae "$pkgdir/usr/bin/wikae"
  install -Dm644 "$pkgdir/opt/Wikae/resources/app/LICENSE" "$pkgdir/usr/share/licenses/$pkgname/LICENSE"
}
